  <item>
    <title>低语playlist⋆꙳是诗、是风、是幻想中的哥特小说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaab1bc051af796b9e94941</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaab1bc051af796b9e94941</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:21:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></em><em><span> 暝尾的祈禱，王榆鈞，2024</span></em></p><p><span>“搖搖 幌幌</span><br><span>烏色的血 佇身軀內流</span><br><span>恬恬咧搖幌</span><br><span>身軀內 烏色的大海”</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a></span></em><em><span> Vive solo, Juana Molina, 2008</span></em></p><p><span>"Solo, vive solo</span></p><p><span>Solo, vive muy solo</span></p><p><span>Y duerme solo, duerme solo"</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a></span></em><em><span> Atomic number, case/lang/veirs, 2016</span></em></p><p><span>"Latin words across my heart</span><br><span>Symbols of infinity</span><br><span>Elements so pure</span><br><span>Atomic number"</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a></span></em><em><span> Sweet the sting, Tori Amos, 2005</span></em></p><p><span>"Can it heal where others before have failed?</span><br><span>If so then somebody</span><br><span>Shake shake shake me sane</span><br><span>Cause I am inching ever closer to the tip of this scorpion's tail"</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a></span></em><em><span> Ambient heat, Lucy Kruger &amp; The lost boys, 2025</span></em></p><p><span>"ambient heat</span><br><span>a palette of tools</span><br><span>to puncture to prime to pin up</span><br><span>to pause"</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a></span></em><em><span> 发明波浪的女儿w，罗思容，2025</span></em></p><p><span>“她們泅泳的姿態各異</span><br><span>有的口吐白沫，有的四腳朝天。</span><br><span>但都不死</span><br><span>波浪前仆後繼”</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a></span></em><em><span> Nettles, Ethel Cain, 2025</span></em></p><p><span>"We were in a race to grow up</span><br><span>Yesterday through today 'til tomorrow</span><br><span>But when the plant blew up</span><br><span>A piece of shrapnel flew and slowed that part of you"</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63123b364657bb4c09f5c7a7/loYgooPmF_F-x6w4bkt1jN6ZHRm3.m4a" length="36025285" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFWokpkUnLK1ONQw_qIHt4zRR9H.jpg"/>
