  <item>
    <title>低语014 坐会Șezătoare：罗马尼亚乡村的女性遗产、档案和共同体</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7f770e17676351c5721067</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7f770e17676351c5721067</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFhDuDZPyNgiGZN07E3Ml0n9xq7.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 乡村的时间单位是四季，坐会（Șezătoare）是冬季共同劳动制度</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTIyr5YW7OOMAJlTx8jfN9a1_o3.jpg" alt=""><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 围绕着劳动，伴随着美食、音乐、舞蹈、游戏和欢声笑语</span></p><ul><li><p><span>小型罗姆人乐队（taraf）</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvZgJyocyyfXE7KJbVR9szR8iA9.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 为什么创造这种劳作形态的是女性？为什么坐在一起纺线、织布、刺绣的，总是女性？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm8hpdu4_LsgDRG1m7v2VzRhEVU5.webp"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 嫁妆箱（ladă de zestre），装着十几年的劳动时间</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZJmxnCz_ya9I5i0YbkkUFeaiTZ.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 她们留下的可触摸的实体、那些创造，那些reliquia</span></p><ul><li><p><span>《奥德赛》中的Penelope</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRv91RGEW0MkeDUzurT_rsUY0PE.webp"></li><li><p><span>Moirai（命运三女神）：Clotho：纺出生命之线、Lachesis：测量生命之线、Atropos：剪断生命之线</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpuVWNwzLze3w8GpktMxqtQ0F2mr.png"></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 纺织品是她们静默的自传，是不可替代的生命布书</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm5VbSs0a64dz5ofYsboPTeVpLW2.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 罗马尼亚传统衬衫（ie）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsccEF1TEwivKWtYGiz8VoIBvF9q.jpeg"><ul><li><p><span>纹样</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNc6M3UC91N-8isOUpLGfOja6C0.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrVt08mJWUEIMZuP3TqTPAqF1YIK.jpg"></li><li><p><span>结构</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzkpvkMd_WmdHoQdmUvBRPYuBNM.jpg"></li></ul><p></p><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FatOTK3BYe4&amp;list=RDFatOTK3BYe4&amp;start_radio=1" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FatOTK3BYe4&amp;list=RDFatOTK3BYe4&amp;start_radio=1"><em><span>cantec de sezatoare</span></em></a></p>]]></description>
