  <item>
    <title>低语013 Anne Teresa与罗莎之舞：颠覆关于女性身体的舞蹈语言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69dd2c60e2c8be315520da8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69dd2c60e2c8be315520da8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Apr 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQEyW22OdRRI8nQlpd2lVzdjlyb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 什么是关于女性的身体想象？要如何利用或者打破这种想象？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Anne Teresa De Keersmaeker：它可以是主动的、固执的、数学的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> “Mudra教会我如何思考舞蹈”“纽约留下节奏”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FguRAzhBpsHrL_QJstFoMpaMg889.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 《相位（</span><em><span>Fase, Four Movements to the Music of Steve Reich）</span></em><span>》横空出世</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkinOoape2uBh_3sSLq5wYhc3KDX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>《罗莎舞罗莎（</span><em><span>Rosas danst Rosas</span></em><span>）》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDUiq1mmsJX1_quq_vkAqsTce5p.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 女性共创的伟大力量</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtzT_oi0euHQpXJOhCc7lEDZ-X7V.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 重复，重复。重复...重复！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 将冷静的几何逻辑和极简的艺术传统放进女性身体</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 沉重的呼吸、真实的疲惫</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYxuINkYE2z-WbHslb4uj4DrMoh.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> Rosas舞团，女性能量的结晶体</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUcJhi5ygeeawrc4iKjU0lKAKhP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> Thierry De Mey，视觉、空间和建筑的语言的转译</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyMSwBuPkgGz0XYOpeGD8a5iJMV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> Anne Teresa的艺术哲学和舞蹈宇宙：“何为编舞？”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 编舞是具身的书法</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnxov4uXrzZV_QwQ1-54iS8c8gtL.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 编舞是在时空中组织动作</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlD1druyAqNCGAJQOv2lN6C1WVBI.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 编舞是挑战重力</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXuL6bkTyfCzA7-JukBpPO8Inx7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 编舞是跳跃和旋转</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flg0aYdV0AMYAs1ady4hyGNf_26h.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 编舞是对人性的赞颂</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> 三个伙伴：音乐、舞者、自然</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulR5VkymdFpbj0-Z4r_GSoZV3EP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 推动比利时成为结构性、音乐性、实验性舞蹈的中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 从规训夺回身体、从叙事中夺回结构，有意识的舞动吧！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXd1_55pu_suCkw1isZJdWuBmne.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>更多信息：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.rosas.be/en/" data-url="https://www.rosas.be/en/"><em><span>Rosas舞团</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.rosasdanstrosas.be/en-home/" data-url="https://www.rosasdanstrosas.be/en-home/"><em><span>Re: Rosas! Project</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mMTUdlEEM5A&amp;t=2747s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mMTUdlEEM5A&amp;t=2747s"><em><span>《罗莎舞罗莎》（1997）</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HpPmH4Wc5AM&amp;list=RDHpPmH4Wc5AM&amp;start_radio=1" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HpPmH4Wc5AM&amp;list=RDHpPmH4Wc5AM&amp;start_radio=1"><em><span>《相位》预告片（2002）</span></em></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvucxb0z1q3iBeGAco-jlfw5DGYx.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63123b364657bb4c09f5c7a7/ltSevFHeGh9F1wstD3qBvKLj90BB.m4a" length="51159531" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:40</itunes:duration>
