  <item>
    <title>低语playlist⋆꙳华语乐坛的原创、新锐和张扬，女孩们啊大声唱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69adcce75b2d0ed069048599</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69adcce75b2d0ed069048599</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 春雨，陳嫺靜，2025</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“唇語唇語 密密麻麻 交織在一起”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 苗儿，Chainhaha，2024</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“蜕吧 蜕吧 等液体充盈你的翅膀 再去飞行”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 羽毛剑，秦凡淇，2025</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“kuhongmila 逢出必达”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> exist, EXIST!, 2z2, 2025</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“我们必须存在”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 淤青了吗？！，张醒蝉，2024</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“只是这样就倒下去？才这样你就倒下去！”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> Tell me，9m88，2022</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“這只是暫時的事情 就是不可以放棄自己”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 沙发，裸儿，2021</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>“随性吧 静静地静静地”</span></p><span></span><p><span>写在最后：分享这两年常听的几位华语新锐女声。她们有着新一代女性的尖锐和觉察，也继承了女性代代相传的创造力和敏感，她们的歌里有情绪、有趣味、有前卫、有巫性，还有“我们存在”的大声宣告。女孩们，国际劳动妇女节快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63123b364657bb4c09f5c7a7/lsUULYfUCf0-2Us4KtVfAK2Rv7vc.m4a" length="23653067" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTGWMsm-dJt-JQVxOX_-9ljHIxz.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>低语012 Ruth Asawa：织子宫、织果实，织世界无数</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6977cb7fef1cf272a7a34cbf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6977cb7fef1cf272a7a34cbf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jan 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj1jEToVDmWAuaFQKvaHRAB9T6hx.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 一个关于移民、关于女性、关于教育，关于用双手创造世界的故事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lq3CdjhBWDVMz_qKI4c5G6EEnHLm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 劳动和土地塑造了她的“第一语言”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4xWurttoFKSfMMGXF3Wfjhfxn3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 身份——边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 铁丝网后与艺术的初遇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fingu9kFL3oY3DVTKh3m5hzrIZp7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 黑山学院 Black Mountain College</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 恩师Albers的第一课：让材料告诉你它想成为什么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frimd-IKV3l14nThrTCsxvzYZ_ot.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 边界溶解了，艺术扎根了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> looping，那么熟悉那么陌生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsJdOAhtrto6hCo4-bSAb1luODDk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 开放性、无限性、双重性</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHq-XFNuS5ebtpH0wFvZlMs_JRm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> “我不是在制作雕塑，而是在延伸材料的生命”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 女性的身体经验、自然的生长形态</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjYGACbbmDo-Yz3fU5Wk4jsnFL9p.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 在编织中育儿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVyCGt2BgrV4NLK8XVLwKwDT_ot.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 在行动中育人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtfVBrxG6Q7M5Wr-BhXVJDkdByzz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 移民后代留下的珍贵礼物，请不要害怕拆开！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 艺术史的纠错与校准：“我已经做了我能做的”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCCj6H9Y5NhNN3pq6tpo1r8-IBs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>更多信息：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ruthasawa.com/" data-url="https://ruthasawa.com/"><em><span>Ruth Asawa官网</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.thenation.com/article/archive/black-mountain-college-poems-review/" data-url="https://www.thenation.com/article/archive/black-mountain-college-poems-review/"><em><span>《黑山学院被忽视的女性》</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Om Gam Mantra, Chantress Seba</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63123b364657bb4c09f5c7a7/ljcQQ53UTp8AJOMJWQI2OkMYfKO2.m4a" length="46754363" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiGwsKL2_hV_JlRyqz3f2yCmG2gB.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
