  <item>
    <title>低语011 超现实主义三女巫：拒绝、抵抗和不死的精神</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690a5fc5ac8cd005c83dbaac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690a5fc5ac8cd005c83dbaac</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpbpdGvWpkgxds70-W80-PhgoAwp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 女巫：“Las Tres Brujas”/“The Three Witchs”，掌握隐秘知识或智慧的人？夜间飞行者？异端？不幸？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 为什么是墨西哥？文化、精神、生态的必然</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>curandera de los sueños梦的治愈者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>nahualismo灵魂变形</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>alebrijes守护灵动物</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dia de Muertos亡灵节</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Tonantzin托南辛</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> Leonora Carrington：我是夜的母马，不是你的造物</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWnUtHW2eAixUV7J2JYM1hiCjBE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Shot by Kati Horna, 1957</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> </span><em><span>The Meal of Lord Candlestick，1938</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft-cM4ZTheP5y02H2ZIPqXYhHYC_.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> </span><em><span>The Portrait of Max Ernest，1939</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpyxDrtimUQk_cCkniJob6Fv-xy.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> </span><em><span>El mundo mágico de los Mayas，1963-64</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj8-t_9e0kKQEw8e_YTln--gtd9H.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> </span><strong><span>Remedios Varo：我不是梦，我是做梦的人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiJn0NLwtfdMzLEAgDlhiwHZEZ00.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> “我是我画里的每个女人”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsloBahjMGKjtQGXdDATCthLOWer.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> </span><em><span>La creación de las aves，1957</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKGDRXiHUP0pTTlZxILgdYCAonH.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 精准控制的构图、丰富系统的符号</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 女性的创造力属于现实</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a></span><strong><span> Kati Horna：透过镜头，我捕捉不可见与自我</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlhErdtkFBqt_6arinja2_N74f3.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 政治早熟的犹太少女</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 为西班牙内战提供女性视角</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqI3Pf5tTiQyGVVnLiWTZ85OlfHl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Escenas en un centro de acogida en Vélez-Rubio, 1937</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> 现实地记录超现实的家庭生活</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrIFSuIBN96ZjufxuU9pI3kpeq35.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Remedios Varo, 1963</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPkvSHtltTRiAcEODDWZ_JhC8IR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Oda a la necrofilia, 1962</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> </span><strong><span>想象力是一种知识，柔软是一种力量，而创作本身，就是一种抵抗。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><h3><em><span>Web of dreams, </span></em><a href="https://open.spotify.com/track/28brRTvreRtW6qQJHe5Qzn" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/track/28brRTvreRtW6qQJHe5Qzn"><em><span>Jorge Reyes</span></em></a></h3>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63123b364657bb4c09f5c7a7/lkRG6Eve9kjiaGI-fe7d6EwEWKMs.m4a" length="65806300" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrBugoth6Nh6R0lv7USQmHkX5Uxj.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
