    <guid isPermaLink="false">689b2c9a032793b18a09c31a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Aug 2025 12:01:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆</span></p><p><span>Music log of the past month. 你会用音乐记录历史吗？</span></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> A Thousand Lies, Smerz, 2025</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>和饼熊在挪威旅行，世界和自我撕开未曾展示的一角</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljKa7_SkDChUGvZ_fe8ENxA2miCm.jpg"></figure><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> Call It Love, Nilüfer Yanya, 2024</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>回家，拥抱一些最柔软的躯体</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fql1_P0ammSysIQdq_bScvcf3aeO.jpg"></figure><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 逃亡，孙燕姿，2001</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>在演唱会上落泪，张开手全部释放</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbXIMQfGZaE5WmHCNbXlIMDr_T4.jpg"></figure><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> Ergelt, Enji, 2025</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>和“野猴”在山间小溪旁用阳光和植物作画，默契是爱的投影</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIP3u0336ORvhnxw2eVm2kEFVpf.jpg"></figure><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 鸽子女王悲泣，风，2025</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>音乐人风出道，悲泣鸽子飞跃天际</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkfEaTE4vWowM2L42ITqMowUZJPQ.png"></figure><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> TRAVELIN' , ((( O ))), 2023</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>再次试图习惯告别，再次失败，只好痛苦地幸福着</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmEuCfYuoNybdNnUhST29hQvkDJG.jpg"></figure><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> サニーボーイ・ラプソディ, toe, 2024</span></em></p><blockquote><p><span>总在“漂流”的人生啊...何时才能靠近光芒的罗盘呢......</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFbAVgigiAXqsTzpCBtabUxoc_z.png"></figure>]]></description>
