  <item>
    <title>低语010 拉美艺术行动主义：那些床上抽烟的女人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685851dc2a38b4d979f7977b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685851dc2a38b4d979f7977b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 19:10:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6iKPSorhXKitjcvgjy_trCLWhN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 《床上抽烟危险》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 我要去拉美啦啊啊啊啊啊啊啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> </span><strong><span>《母性艺术行动主义：80年代拉丁美洲女艺术家概述》by Lara Demori</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“母性的身体具有一种矛盾的状态，它既自然又特殊，是一种被高度认可却又受到限制的女性呈现形态；正如裸体一般，既是强烈的文化意象，又是一种身体状态，它不稳定因而兼具多重含义。”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>罗斯玛丽·贝特顿（Rosemary Betterton）、安吉拉·戴维斯 (Angela Davis)、安德里亚·利斯 (Andrea Liss)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>主体间性、卑贱理论、关怀伦理学</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>玛塔·玛丽亚·佩雷斯·布拉沃（Marta María Pérez Bravo）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlSDMHV6VnhA8Qj_wQKQFCk7-dk-.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>约翰娜·哈曼（Johanna Hamann）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJEOTjPQ5__407Ey9gJx9Nj7MYX.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>芭芭拉·卡拉斯科（Barbara Carrasco）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flo--5DGjKWgZ_LUieu_fvjUmFGG.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>何塞利·卡瓦略（Josely Carvalho）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2s4e42eYNsLsfwEFWzAqqk7bgP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> </span><strong><span>《创造与治愈：巴西原住民女性艺术家的艺术行动主义》by Kássia Borges Mytara</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnxh5rqH_c6oPzR9Xq7C9ZaTVG9q.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>非时间时间Tempo Não Tempo</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>卡梅齐亚·埃米利亚诺 (Carmézia Emiliano）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqhbIs1snxEpA6KxnR_WqCFuRUD.webp"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>雅卡·胡尼·库因（Yaka Huni Kuin）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGhHlpmeSYPNqoW_bJR5WMoLF58.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>奥琳达·亚瓦尔·图皮南巴 (Olinda Yawar Tupinambá）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3EYzkznpBHiAzT6irnHNuxiPDs.webp"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>雅库纳·图克萨（Yacunã Tuxá）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmZYMR5L81c9BzObIPawDYmWOYmz.webp"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>乌伊拉·索多玛（Uýra Sodoma）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFTy8TT3CdfgE6vSZI5dvIkGpOm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>文章链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://awarewomenartists.com/en/magazine/artivisme-maternel-tour-dhorizon-des-artistes-latino-americaines-des-annees-1980/" data-url="https://awarewomenartists.com/en/magazine/artivisme-maternel-tour-dhorizon-des-artistes-latino-americaines-des-annees-1980/"><em><span>AWARE: Maternal artivism</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://awarewomenartists.com/en/magazine/creer-et-guerir-lartivisme-des-artistes-autochtones-au-bresil/" data-url="https://awarewomenartists.com/en/magazine/creer-et-guerir-lartivisme-des-artistes-autochtones-au-bresil/"><em><span>AWARE: To create and heal</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>更多信息：</span></p><span></span><p><a href=" https://www.douban.com/note/638660624/?_i=83532329QViQOn,83557199QViQOn" data-url=" https://www.douban.com/note/638660624/?_i=83532329QViQOn,83557199QViQOn"><em><span>译：鲍里斯·格罗伊斯 - 艺术行动主义</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ro.scribd.com/document/800113888/%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%85-%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E5%A8%83%E5%8D%91%E8%B4%B1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%91%E8%B4%B1%E8%80%85%E5%BD%A2%E8%B1%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6" data-url="https://ro.scribd.com/document/800113888/%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%85-%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E5%A8%83%E5%8D%91%E8%B4%B1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%8E%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%91%E8%B4%B1%E8%80%85%E5%BD%A2%E8%B1%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6"><em><span>茱莉娅·克里斯蒂娃卑贱理论与女性卑贱者形象的研究</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ideelart.com/zh-hans/blogs/magazine/motherhood-maternity-femaleness-gender-judy-chicago-s-birth-project" data-url="https://ideelart.com/zh-hans/blogs/magazine/motherhood-maternity-femaleness-gender-judy-chicago-s-birth-project"><em><span>母性、孕产、女性、性别 - 朱迪·芝加哥的《出生项目》</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href=" https://mephilosophy.ccu.edu.tw/entry.php?entry_name=%E9%97%9C%E6%87%B7%E5%80%AB%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8" data-url=" https://mephilosophy.ccu.edu.tw/entry.php?entry_name=%E9%97%9C%E6%87%B7%E5%80%AB%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8"><em><span>关怀伦理学</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://sociologyol.ruc.edu.cn/shxyj/fzshx/xbshx/96a6549a5642491d801672b93fb6f8f8.htm" data-url="http://sociologyol.ruc.edu.cn/shxyj/fzshx/xbshx/96a6549a5642491d801672b93fb6f8f8.htm"><em><span>母职策略：城市中产女性孕产期的母职实践</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Bororo，</span></em><a href="https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCaNwi1aWo09oZa1rMlamRXQ" data-url="https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCaNwi1aWo09oZa1rMlamRXQ"><em><span>J.Pool</span></em></a><em><span>、</span></em><a href="https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCOZrz86jMzzXPAgSMw3TPwg" data-url="https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCOZrz86jMzzXPAgSMw3TPwg"><em><span>Alunawachuma</span></em></a><em><span>和</span></em><a href="https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCKeaGkTZ3Mny8xlnAW8OEtA" data-url="https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCKeaGkTZ3Mny8xlnAW8OEtA"><em><span>Katy Inti Lamadrid</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><em><span>（巴西原住民博罗罗人音乐）</span></em></p>]]></description>
