  <item>
    <title>低语Playlist⋆꙳巫气女声，唤醒脉轮、觉知、真言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fbed63623bc78c3967ef2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fbed63623bc78c3967ef2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:14:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆⋆꙳•̩̩͙❅*̩̩͙‧͙ ‧͙*̩̩͙❆ ͙͛ ˚₊⋆</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Tong Poo, 矢野顕子, 1980</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Muladhara，稳固、世俗，身体的果实</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> For Her, Fiona Apple, 2020</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Svadhisthana，子宫、感性、性感，探索其他生命</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> Puddle (of me), Saya Gary, 2025</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Manipura，开放心胸，平衡自信与力量</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> Bethlehem, Men I trust, 2025</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Anahata，爱、慈悲、喜悦，创造实相与奇迹</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> El Galatzó, Lucrecia Dalt, 2022</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Visuddha，精微、波能、节律，对谎言警惕</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 一呼...一吸，林忆莲，2024</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Ajna，看见、全息，鲜活的体验</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> La Soñadora, Enya, 2020</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Sahasrara，根本的自性</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>写在最后：【新栏目】是受到某位评价我的车载音乐过于阴间的男性的启发，我原本以为音乐是喜好的差异，至多关乎品味的高低，却没想到它还能测试我们灵魂外衣的厚度。我不想带着怜悯或愤怒看待这件事，不愿玷污这些音乐带给我的平静和包容。于是我再次跟随爱的指引，希望用这些“低语”吸引到些更加轻盈的灵魂吧ʢᴗ.ᴗʡᶻ</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63123b364657bb4c09f5c7a7/lseogoEH9XXshLN6g5M8GCzxGFCb.m4a" length="25330218" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqU3jFlYM8fL7hyhCUD8yXJIWtue.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
