    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQnCWqahAN5lPX9cpwB0JzdxhL6.png"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 终局。这是终局。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> Maguy Marin: Time to act!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 法国新舞蹈浪潮的Pina Bausch</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> May B，为了贝克特</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> The heart of humanity</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 关于个体组成的集体以及集体中的个体</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMzjK7YitQyJAcTOkX5Fm53g7Tu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 两个五星舞评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> The impct of gesture, the power of image</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 拒绝那些“美”的暴力</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWCbESky5EPHUpudiPRLIIVSzJo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 舞台上的灰、舒伯特的冬，Jesus's blood never failed me yet</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgmFEV7nppv9jXWN9N2eFuHGy4MS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 走进剧场吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6/27-6/27，阿那亚戏剧节；7/4-7/5，上海国际舞蹈中心</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多信息：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://videotanz.ru/dance/maguy-marin-lurgence-dagir/" data-url="https://videotanz.ru/dance/maguy-marin-lurgence-dagir/"><em><span>Time to act纪录片</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://compagnie-maguy-marin.fr/tournees" data-url="https://compagnie-maguy-marin.fr/tournees"><em><span>Maguy Marin舞团演出信息</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Schubert: Winterreise, D. 911: No. 1, Gute Nacht, by Valentina Lisitsa</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Schubert: Winterreise, D. 911: No. 5, Der Lindenbaum, by Dietrich Fischer-Dieskau&amp;Alfred Brendel</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Jesus' Blood Never Failed Me Yet, Gavin Bryars</span></em></p><span></span><h1><br></h1>]]></description>
